  "start": "start",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "They all talk at once, then they all stop and look at you. The turbine hums.",
      "next": "pitches"
    },
    {
      "id": "pitches",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Hear each pitch, or decide now.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Strand, go.",
          "next": "p_strand",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "strand_alive",
              "eq": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jory, go.",
          "next": "p_jory",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "jory_alive",
              "eq": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bea, go.",
          "next": "p_bea",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "bea_alive",
              "eq": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[Decide]",
          "next": "decide"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p_strand",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "A list. Honest this time. Capacity is 400 heated beds. We pick by survivability. It saves the most.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "next": "p_strand_t",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "ch02_strand_truth",
              "eq": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "next": "pitches"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p_strand_t",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "You knew about the 41 days before anyone. You kept it. So you know I can count, and I can lie. I won't.",
      "next": "pitches"
    },
    {
      "id": "p_jory",
      "speaker": "jory",
      "text": "Strip it, haul it north. Mine shafts sit at seven degrees forever. We farm under lamps. It saves the Range.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "next": "p_jory_t",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "jory_secret_known",
              "eq": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "next": "pitches"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p_jory_t",
      "speaker": "jory",
      "text": "Thirty-one names in my coat, neighbor. I'm not asking you to trust me. I'm asking you to trust the rock.",
      "next": "pitches"
    },
    {
      "id": "p_bea",
      "speaker": "bea",
      "text": "The Harbor runs it. We've fed people all winter. Show of hands... okay, fine, it's my turn, I know.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "next": "p_bea_t",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "bea_guns_known",
              "eq": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "next": "pitches"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p_bea_t",
      "speaker": "bea",
      "text": "And yes, I bought guns with grain. Those guns are why there's a Harbor to have a vote. Here's the deal.",
      "next": "pitches"
    },
    {
      "id": "decide",
      "speaker": "theo",
      "text": "ma. hank said ask the room. so... ask the room?",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "A council. Everyone at one table.",
          "next": "c_council",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "kindness",
              "gte": 5
            },
            {
              "flag": "dam_running",
              "eq": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Strand runs it. The list.",
          "next": "c_auth",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "strand_alive",
              "eq": true
            },
            {
              "flag": "rep_authority",
              "gte": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Compact takes it north.",
          "next": "c_compact",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "jory_alive",
              "eq": true
            },
            {
              "flag": "rep_compact",
              "gte": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[Open the spillways. Shut it down.]",
          "next": "c_shutdown"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Take Theo and go]",
          "next": "c_leave"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c_council",
      "speaker": "dell",
      "text": "Not mine. Not yours. Ours. Every name in this room goes on the board, and we argue it out.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "set": "final_choice",
          "value": "council"
        }
      ],
      "next": "r_council"
    },
    {
      "id": "r_council",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Bea laughs. Jory groans. Strand, if she's here, picks up the chalk.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "next": "warm",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "dam_running",
              "eq": true
            },
            {
              "flag": "kindness",
              "gte": 5
            },
            {
              "count_true": [
                "pruitt_alive",
                "wren_alive",
                "ray_alive",
                "cody_alive",
                "marguerite_alive",
                "ruiz_defected",
                "lunds_stayed"
              ],
              "gte": 3
            },
            {
              "any": [
                {
                  "flag": "rep_harbor",
                  "gte": 2
                },
                {
                  "flag": "strand_stance",
                  "eq": "governor"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "ruiz_defected",
                  "eq": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "next": "council_fail"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "council_fail",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "But too few people trust each other. Too few are left. By the second vote, the room has split.",
      "next": "two_coats"
    },
    {
      "id": "warm",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "THE WARM ROOM.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "set": "ending",
          "value": "end_warm_room"
        }
      ],
      "next": "end"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_auth",
      "speaker": "dell",
      "text": "Run the list, Yvonne. Make it honest.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "set": "final_choice",
          "value": "authority"
        },
        {
          "set": "ending",
          "value": "end_ledger"
        }
      ],
      "next": "ledger"
    },
    {
